title: Old Joe Clark
key: A
type: instrumental
form: AABB
feel: 2/4, fast
rights: public-domain
notes: Mixolydian. B part drops to the b7 (G in A).
verified: false
break: Use the b7 (G in A) everywhere — the tune is mixolydian, not plain major.
break.guitar: Fiddle-style: lots of open strings, and slide into the b7 on the B part.

[A]
| 1 | 1 | 1 | 5 |
| 1 | 1 | 5 | 1 |

[B]
| 1 | 1 | b7 | b7 |
| 1 | 1 | 5 | 1 |
